SUMMARY:The Social Set: Padel & Pickleball 
DESCRIPTION:Category: Sports & Games\nPrice: Free / Included\nStatus: You a
 re on Waitlist\nEvent URL: https://members.thequinhouse.com/events/201347\
 n\n2:00PM Pro-Led Instruction\, 2:30PM Open Play\, 4:00PM - Recovery and M
 ember Mingling\n\nJoin us for an offsite afternoon of play as The 'Quin Ho
 use takes over the courts at Ballers in the Seaport. Whether you're pickin
 g up the racquet for the first time\, or have tried the sport and would li
 ke to learn more\, members are invited to experience two of today’s mos
 t exciting racquet sports\, pickleball and padel\, in a lively\, social se
 tting.\n\nThe afternoon will begin with professional instructors Johny Mar
 io\, Ballers Head Pickleball Pro\, and Leo Justus\, General Manager and Pa
 del Pro\, giving members guidance before moving into rotating play and fri
 endly matches across both sports\, guided by the Ballers team. Members wil
 l have the opportunity to rotate between pickleball and padel courts to ex
 perience both racquet sports with pros and members. Post play\, members ca
 n stick around to mix\, mingle\, and enjoy food and drinks for purchase at
  the Ballers food trucks and bar. After play\, members are welcome to sti
 ck around to mix\, mingle\, and enjoy food and drinks available for purcha
 se from the Ballers food trucks and bar.\n\n*This event is complimentary a
 nd reserved for members only. We kindly ask that all cancellations be made
